  "_note": "Fixed 18-world mechanism diagnostic using already-inspected information-development seeds, not independent validation or calibration. All arms share a 252-day ordinary-report baseline through day 600. From day 601 cross 252/63/21-trading-day ordinary publishing with audit certificate publication off/on; these are model year/quarter/month conventions, not observed ESG schedules or legal requirements. Audit probability, fine, subsidy, transparency, error scale, project delays and finance parameters stay fixed. All firms share global phase zero; report calendars do not reset at intervention. Interpret frequency jointly with these fixed calendar phases and contract repricing, not as a phase-averaged monotonic dose effect. Completed records can be audited before investor publication (model A); every selected check refreshes its ordinary report at close and public certificates start next day. Zero fine is a declared washing-activation control, not a realistic policy estimate. No parameter selection, seed replacement, automatic expansion, policy ranking or confirmatory claim is licensed. Keep all failures and prepolicy/archival checks. Market stability, empirical fit and Q learning remain separate gates.",
